  "body_html": "<article class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-12 @md:gap-16 mt-10\"><div class=\"@container w-full max-w-container @md:shaded-container:px-0!\"><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"--hero-aspect-ratio:16/9;--hero-aspect-ratio-mobile:3/4\"><div class=\"@container w-full multi-columns:px-0 @md:shaded-container:px-0! toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\" data-section-header=\"true\"><div class=\"col-span-full col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-10 @md:col-start-2 @lg:col-span-8 @lg:col-start-3\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"meta\"><p class=\"text-meta text-primary-100\">November 11, 2026</p><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-meta text-primary-60 hover:text-primary-100\" href=\"/news/company-announcements/\">Company</a></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"text-h1 toc-collision-target max-w-250 text-primary-100 text-balance scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"headline\">ChatGPT Plus for veterans and servicemembers</h1></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\"><div class=\"@container col-span-full w-full min-w-0 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-3\" data-show-toc=\"true\"><div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] @md:w-full article-actions-spacing pt-20 w-full\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 flex w-full flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-t-primary-4 pt-3\" data-article-hero-actions=\"true\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"support\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 ms-auto\"><div class=\"relative\"><div aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" data-state=\"closed\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-cta\"><button class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 disabled:text-primary-44 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-primary-44 px-0 !rounded\" type=\"button\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"17\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.52 7.62a.875.875 0 0 1 1.244 1.232L4.67 9.957l-.003.003c-1.384 1.385-1.421 3.658.147 5.227 1.568 1.568 3.842 1.531 5.227.147l.002-.002 1.107-1.095a.875.875 0 0 1 1.231 1.243l-1.106 1.096c-2.105 2.1-5.485 2.062-7.698-.152s-2.251-5.592-.15-7.697z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M11.881 6.881A.876.876 0 0 1 13.12 8.12l-5 5a.876.876 0 0 1-1.24-1.24z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M8.726 3.425c2.105-2.1 5.485-2.063 7.698.15s2.252 5.594.15 7.699L15.48 12.38a.875.875 0 0 1-1.244-1.231l1.095-1.107.003-.002c1.384-1.385 1.421-3.659-.147-5.227s-3.842-1.53-5.227-.147l-.003.003-1.106 1.095a.876.876 0 0 1-1.23-1.244z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path></svg>Share</button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col col-span-full min-w-0 md:row-start-1\" data-toc-content=\"\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"000-veterans-are-using-chatgpt-to-build-what-comes-next\"><div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>20,000 veterans are using ChatGPT to build what comes next</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>In the past year, more than 20,000 transitioning servicemembers and veterans have claimed a year of </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"/index/chatgpt-for-veterans/\"><span>ChatGPT Plus at no cost</span></a><span> after being offered free access by OpenAI. That milestone gives us a chance to look at how veterans are using AI to prepare for civilian careers and to figure out what comes next for themselves and their families.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>The effort started with veterans who work here at OpenAI, people who use these tools every day and know firsthand how challenging the transition can be. Beyond the free access, OpenAI Academy and our community partners have hosted more than a dozen trainings for nearly 1,000 members of the military community, </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://academy.openai.com/home/events\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>with seven more</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> scheduled before the year ends.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"preparing-for-civilian-careers\"><div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Preparing for civilian careers</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Leaving the military often means stepping into an unfamiliar job market and working out how years of service translate into a civilian role. Many veterans are turning to ChatGPT to organize their job search, rehearse for interviews, and explore paths they hadn’t considered.</span></p></div><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3 toc-collision-target relative z-10 rounded-md bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"prose max-w-full p-6 @md:p-8 [&amp;_li_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_li_ul]:mt-2 [&amp;_ol]:mt-0 [&amp;_p]:mt-0 [&amp;_ul]:mt-0\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full flex min-w-0 flex-col [--component-container-gutter:0px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col\" data-article-contained=\"\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\">Air Force veteran <a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACoAACLpKeMBgVdc2b2nami8B_Wr_EecZXqRfDY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tilak Bhatnagar<!-- -->⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a> used his free year to prepare for a dozen interviews, find the right words to describe his military experience to civilian employers, and weigh competing job offers. Along the way, those conversations helped him clarify what he actually wanted from life after active duty.</p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\">He ultimately took a role at a tech company. What he valued most was being able to pick up where he left off, returning to the same thread about his background, goals, and constraints. As he put it, “each conversation built on the last.”</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3 toc-collision-target relative z-10 rounded-md bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"prose max-w-full p-6 @md:p-8 [&amp;_li_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_li_ul]:mt-2 [&amp;_ol]:mt-0 [&amp;_p]:mt-0 [&amp;_ul]:mt-0\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full flex min-w-0 flex-col [--component-container-gutter:0px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col\" data-article-contained=\"\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACoAAFDy8p8BLQADQImjs514hHT6yRuJ2ym1r6k\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sadarian Bell<!-- -->⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a>, also an Air Force veteran, started planning more than a year before he left the service. He used ChatGPT to map out his transition and to turn nearly a decade of military healthcare experience into a civilian résumé.</p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\">To prepare for interviews, he practiced out loud using ChatGPT voice mode, working through one question at a time until his answers felt natural. “It has genuinely become my career coach,” Sadarian said, though he also learned to recognize when he’d had enough help and could trust his own judgment.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3 toc-collision-target relative z-10 rounded-md bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"prose max-w-full p-6 @md:p-8 [&amp;_li_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_li_ul]:mt-2 [&amp;_ol]:mt-0 [&amp;_p]:mt-0 [&amp;_ul]:mt-0\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full flex min-w-0 flex-col [--component-container-gutter:0px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col\" data-article-contained=\"\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\">For Navy veteran <a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kelliann-ramirez-hart-540a475a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kelli Ramirez<!-- -->⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a>, the transition was a chance to chase a long-held dream: becoming a published author. She’d already invested in a book-writing course to sharpen her craft, and ChatGPT filled in the gaps. “ChatGPT helped me organize ideas, ask questions about publishing, and work through the Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing process,” she said.</p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\">Kelli has since published two books, which she says “reflect my desire to help women approach technology with confidence and, for those who share my Christian faith, with wisdom grounded in that faith.”</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"learning-to-use-chatgpt-together\"><div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Learning to use ChatGPT, together</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Not everyone arrives confident about using AI tools, which is why OpenAI Academy gives veterans, transitioning servicemembers, and military spouses a place to learn alongside people who understand what they’re going through.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>OpenAI recently wrapped our first six-event Academy series with </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://veteransforge.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Veterans Forge</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span>, focused on helping veterans and military families use ChatGPT to work toward their goals. That pilot, together with workshops alongside AI Collective Hampton Roads and NPower, is shaping what we offer veterans next.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>At one </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://academy.openai.com/en/public/events/openai-academy-for-veterans-w8zz8dfrts\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>workshop in Reston, Virginia</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span>, nearly </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/erinrosemarie_veterans-ai-aicommunity-activity-7440044135958384640-j7S-\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>100 veterans and active-duty servicemembers</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> explored ways to put AI to work. Participant </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryan-kaono-wedemeyer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Ryan Kaono-Wedemeyer</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> learned to start by writing out a detailed account of his military experience, then asking AI to help shape it into a civilian résumé.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Instructor </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/erinrosemarie_veterans-ai-aicommunity-activity-7440044135958384640-j7S-\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Erin Marie</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> helped participants build custom GPTs to support their transitions, and watched people who walked in skeptical begin finding ways the tools could genuinely help them.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>In Louisville, Kentucky, </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/veterans-forge_theamericanlegion-veteransforge-veterans-activity-7499820737151541248-PqzY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>more than 80 Legionnaires</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> attended three AI training sessions at the American Legion’s national convention. For those who can’t make it to an event, our </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://academy.openai.com/public/collections/veterans\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>online veterans collection</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> and </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://chatgpt.com/use-cases/veterans?openaicom-did=fe90cf14-c5f6-4d62-bed8-21350e39f4f6&amp;openaicom_referred=true\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>100 chats for veterans</span>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> offer examples to try on your own.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"whats-next\"><div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>What’s next</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>We’re continuing this work with partners across the country throug